- **On the Discover hub but defined elsewhere:** Generative AI and Multimodal AI (`/use-cases/`), LLMs (`/ai/llms`), RAG and Fine-tuning (`/use-cases/`), NLP (`/learn/`), Data labeling (`/use-cases/`).
- **Concepts with no dedicated explainer page** (referenced inline only): Transformer architecture, embeddings/vector embeddings, diffusion models, computer vision, speech recognition, recommendation systems, TPU, knowledge graph, responsible AI (covered as product/principles pages, real URLs given above).
